---
import Legal from "@/layouts/Legal.astro";
import { href } from "@/lib/utils";
---
<Legal title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for the Iron Lantern Studios site.">
  <p>This site collects nothing about you. It has no analytics, no ads, no tracking scripts and no accounts. It sets no cookies and stores nothing in your browser. The fonts, the 3D engine and every script load from this site itself, so your browser talks to no other company while you read it.</p>
  <h2>The contact form</h2>
  <p>The form on the <a href={href("contact")}>Contact page</a> never sends anything to this site. It opens your own email app with your message filled in. When you send it, I receive a normal email, and I keep it only as long as I need to reply. Ask me to delete it any time.</p>
  <h2>Buying</h2>
  <p>When you press a "Buy here" button, a checkout page from my payment provider opens. That provider collects your payment details and your email address so it can send you the download and a receipt, under its own privacy policy. I see your email and what you bought. I never see your card.</p>
  <p>If you buy on Steam, itch.io, Google Play, the App Store, Fab or Roblox instead, that store handles your details under its own policy.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The company hosting this site may keep standard server logs, such as your IP address, under its own privacy statement.</p>
  <h2>Your data</h2>
  <p>Email the address on the Contact page to ask what I hold about you or to have it deleted. I'll answer within 30 days.</p>
</Legal>
